--- task
id: r09
dataset: reading
kind: bounded multi-hop
answer: fewest

--- intent
Which documents can be reached from the document `$doc` by following at most 2 citations? Return their slugs.

--- params
{"doc": "d1"}

--- edition2
query within_two($doc: String) {
  match { $d: Doc { slug: $doc }  $d cites{1,2} $o }
  return { $o.slug }
}

--- edition3
query within_two($doc: String) {
  match { $d: Doc { slug: $doc }  $d cites{1,2} $o }
  return { $o.slug }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["o.slug"]
["d3"]
["d4"]
["d0"]
